For my application, I use the following code snippet to do this exact thing (on v1.35), tho sometimes the page doesn't refresh properly, hence why I also put a refresh button.. for just in case:
```
if st.toggle("Dark Mode", value=True) is False:
      st._config.set_option(f'theme.base', "light")
else:
      st._config.set_option(f'theme.base', "dark")
if st.button("Refresh"):
      st.rerun()
```
